# BESA one-domain website: reversible proxy rewrites during transition.
# CRITICAL: Netlify normalizes trailing slashes BEFORE matching redirects.
# NEVER add '/office /office/ 301' or '/onboarding /onboarding/ 301' —
# those become self-redirects on Netlify and break the entire page.
# A single /office rule matches /office and /office/; same for onboarding.
# All specific page rewrites are before the asset wildcard.
/onboarding    https://besmir-cpu.github.io/BESA-Logistics/candidate-onboarding.html 200!
/onboarding/*  https://besmir-cpu.github.io/BESA-Logistics/:splat 200!
/office        https://besmir-cpu.github.io/BESA-Logistics/index.html 200!
/office/*      https://besmir-cpu.github.io/BESA-Logistics/:splat 200!
